TECHNICAL DECISIONS
---

1. Runner Selection
   - x86_64: ubuntu-22.04 (GitHub-hosted, widely available)
   - aarch64: ubuntu-22.04-arm (GitHub large runner, Graviton-based)
   - Rationale: Official GitHub runners ensure CI reproducibility

2. Deterministic Environment
   - LANG=C, LC_ALL=C, TZ=UTC (locale/timezone normalization)
   - SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH from git commit timestamp (build reproducibility)
   - Rust cache with platform-specific keys (avoid cross-arch cache pollution)

3. Artifact Collection
   - verdict.json: Latest report-*.json from qlever-verify harness
   - environment.json: Custom JSON with platform details (arch, Rust version, OS, commit)
   - receipts/*.cbor: All CBOR files from RECEIPT_STORAGE_PATH
   - manifest.txt: Human-readable artifact inventory

4. Verification Gate
   - Runs qlever-verify contract mode (< 120s fast checks)
   - Timeout: 180s (safety margin)
   - Parallel: 4 executors
   - Continue-on-error: true (artifact collection always runs)

5. Comparison Strategy
   - Primary check: gate_result field equality (PASS/FAIL/TIMEOUT/PARTIAL)
   - Secondary check: receipt count parity (same number of CBOR files)
   - Tertiary check: receipt hash comparison (determinism validation)
   - Note: Perfect hash match requires identical timestamps (SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH enforced)

